The legal texts are Vietnamese legislation as published by the Ministry of Justice national legal
database (https://vbpl.vn), retrieved 29 October 2026.

Legal normative documents are, under Vietnamese law, outside copyright protection. Law on Intellectual
Property (Luật Sở hữu trí tuệ, Law No. 50/2005/QH11, as amended), Article 15: legal normative documents,
administrative documents and other documents in the judicial field, and their official translations,
are not subject to copyright protection. (Lexifina has not verified this wording against the official
gazette copy of the Law; check the original before relying on it.)

Changes made by Lexifina: the text of each version was converted to one Markdown file per provision
(Điều), one clause or item per line; footnote numbers and page furniture were left out; and the versions
were arranged as git commits credited to the law that made them. The wording of the law was not changed.
Lexifina is not affiliated with the Ministry of Justice or the National Assembly of Vietnam.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
